# Accepted for this demo, see docs/tradeoffs.md:
# AVD-AWS-0178  VPC flow logs are not enabled (cost); would be on in a real platform.
AVD-AWS-0178
# AVD-AWS-0057  wildcard actions in the day-0 deployer policy (bootstrap/aws-account): EC2/RDS
#               resource ARNs are unknown before creation; IAM is scoped to the service prefix.
AVD-AWS-0057
# AVD-AWS-0104  app pods may reach 0.0.0.0/0 on 443 only (AWS APIs via NAT, needed for IRSA/STS).
#               Real account: VPC endpoints for STS/ECR, then point the rule at their SG.
AVD-AWS-0104
